CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n\n<li>Recent hormone test results</li>\n\n<li>Previous pelvic ultrasound reports</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your PCOS and Hirsutism Clinic consultation with confidence</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>Polycystic ovary syndrome affects several body systems, so treating a single symptom in isolation may not address the underlying problem. At this clinic, endocrinologists and gynaecologists see patients jointly, with dermatologists joining when excess hair growth or acne is a concern. MedLuxLife arranges your appointments at our partner hospital and coordinates follow-up visits with the [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 2, "featured_media": 0, "parent": 259, "menu_order": 28, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "template": "page-with-title", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "permalink_template": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/%pagename%/", "generated_slug": "pcos-and-hirsutism-clinic", "class_list": ["post-501", "page", "type-page", "status-publish", "hentry"], "_links